{"id":"637716","name":"卤鸭翅","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637716/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭翅膀","amount":"1000克"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒸鱼豉油","amount":"100克"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"800克"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"几个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好鸭翅膀，清洗干净。","img":"images/637716/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水上锅。","img":"images/637716/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"一起下入鸭翅、姜片、料酒。","img":"images/637716/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火烧开，焯水3分钟。","img":"images/637716/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净浮沫。","img":"images/637716/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次倒入锅中，加100克蒸鱼豉油，小火。","img":"images/637716/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/637716/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入800克纯净水和米椒。","img":"images/637716/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火烧开，转中小火，煮20分钟左右，收干汤汁。","img":"images/637716/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"好了(颜色有点深)。","img":"images/637716/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图(不喜欢这么深的颜色，可以不要收干汤汁就捞出来)。","img":"images/637716/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}